                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, lance, shield, and warhorse. May upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). First Charge. May count a Rank Bonus of up to +1 in combat. (Vlad the Impaler p.98)</characteristic>
