            <profile id="0678-13ff-c56a-878f" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Bow, improvised weapon. Every second unit may have staff slings (+2 pts). Open Order. Any Panic test that results in a natural roll of higher than a 7 is a failure regardless of character influence. (Vlad the Impaler p.98)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
