              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, and horse. May have a shield (+2 pts) and javelins (free). Allies and Mercenaries. Skirmishers. Nomad Cavalry. (Vlad the Impaler p.98)</characteristic>
