              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, shield, bow or light crossbow, thrusting spear, and horse. May take lance (+2 pts), javelins (+2 pts), or light armour (+2 pts). Allies and Mercenaries. Skirmishers. Feigned Flight and Parthian Shot, and become Open Order if they upgrade to light armour. (Vlad the Impaler p.98)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="cdfa-2e30-aefa-78df" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
