  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="314e-bc2e-da38-be52" name="Catalan Company (Vlad the Impaler) - List Notes" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false">
      <description>THE CATALAN COMPANY (Vlad the Impaler, p.98): the Grand Catalan Company. Allies from other lists are documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Catalan Company]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 75%, at least 25%
  Allies and Mercenaries: up to 25%
  THE CATALAN COMPANY. Characters up to 25%; Cavalry up to 25%; Infantry 25-75% (may take 0-1 Mangonel for each 2,000 points); Allies and Mercenaries up to 25% - the Catalan Company may select allies from the Byzantine Empire list (documented only). All such units are subject to the Allies and Mercenaries rule.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
